sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant O as Order Service
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant G as Gateway
    C->>O: POST /orders
    O-->>C: 202 PENDING
    O-->>B: OrderCreated
    B-->>S: OrderCreated
    S-->>B: ReserveStock
    B-->>I: ReserveStock
    I-->>B: StockReserved
    B-->>S: StockReserved
    S-->>B: ChargePayment
    B-->>P: ChargePayment
    P->>G: Cobrança HTTPS (idempotente)
    G-->>P: CHARGED
    P-->>B: PaymentCharged
    B-->>S: PaymentCharged
    S-->>B: AllocateStock
    B-->>I: AllocateStock
    I-->>B: StockAllocated (não expede)
    B-->>S: StockAllocated
    S-->>B: ConfirmOrder
    B-->>O: ConfirmOrder
    O-->>B: OrderConfirmationRejected (definitivo)
    B-->>S: Rejeição comprovada (não timeout)
    rect rgb(255, 245, 227)
      S-->>B: RefundPayment
      B-->>P: RefundPayment
      P->>G: Solicita estorno idempotente
      G-->>P: REFUNDED confirmado
      P-->>B: PaymentRefunded
      B-->>S: PaymentRefunded
      S-->>B: ReleaseStock
      B-->>I: ReleaseStock (ALLOCATED -> RELEASED)
      I-->>B: StockReleased
      B-->>S: StockReleased
      S-->>B: CancelOrder
      B-->>O: CancelOrder
      O-->>B: OrderCancelled
      B-->>S: OrderCancelled -> COMPENSATED
    end
    Note over S,O: Timeout de ConfirmOrder exige consulta antes do refund
